### Create a match (replace with actual IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchDateId": "REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_DATE_ID",
  "homeClubId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID_1",
  "awayClubId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID_2",
  "scheduledTime": "2026-03-15T16:00:00"
}

### Create another match
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchDateId": "REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_DATE_ID",
  "homeClubId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID_2",
